   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "その国の噂を聞いたのは    \r港の汚い酒場だった        ",
   "en": "I first heard of that kingdom in a filthy dockside tavern.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4eea0",
   "off": 323232,
   "op": "22",
