   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4eea3",
   "off": 323235,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "王国の名はモーダルグロウ  \rまたの名を癒しの王国      ",
   "en": "It was called Modalglow, also known as the Kingdom of Healing.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4eee0",
   "off": 323296,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4eee3",
   "off": 323299,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "その国の医者と魔術師たちは\r失った腕や脚すら造り直して\rしまうというから          ",
   "en": "Its doctors and sorcerers, they said, could even rebuild lost arms and legs.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4ef39",
   "off": 323385,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4ef3c",
   "off": 323388,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "病人、けが人たちが押しかけるのも無理はない",
   "en": "No wonder the sick and the wounded flocked there.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4ef6c",
   "off": 323436,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4ef71",
   "off": 323441,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "新しい国王が即位して以来  \r密かに軍備を増強している  \rとも聞いた                ",
   "en": "I'd also heard that ever since the new King took the throne, the realm had been quietly building up its army.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4efc7",
   "off": 323527,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4efcc",
   "off": 323532,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "確かに俺はまだ一介の傭兵  \rだが                      \r腕には自信がある          ",
   "en": "Sure, I was just another mercenary. But I knew what my sword arm could do.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT00:4f022",
